# Pairs with CommitIntegrity. A coordinator that records commit without
# consulting the votes commits a saga in which a participant nacked its
# prepare, which is the "commit despite a failed precondition" defect.
MODULE: CommitIntegrityIgnoresVotes
TARGET: CommitIntegrity
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: records commit without consulting the prepare votes, so a nacked saga commits

--- FIND
    /\ decision' = [decision EXCEPT ![t] = IF AllAcked(t) THEN "committed" ELSE "aborted"]
    /\ phase' = [phase EXCEPT ![t] = IF AllAcked(t) THEN "committing" ELSE "aborting"]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the decision no longer depends on AllAcked(t). Every saga commits,
\* including one whose participant reported a precondition or write failure.
    /\ decision' = [decision EXCEPT ![t] = "committed"]
    /\ phase' = [phase EXCEPT ![t] = "committing"]
--- END
